  "pullRequests": {
    "275576": {
      "id": "pr:microsoft/vscode#275576",
      "repository": "microsoft/vscode",
      "number": 275576,
      "title": "Fix terminal suggestions not dismissed on resize",
      "body": "Fixes #258694\r\n\r\nTerminal suggestions remain visible after terminal resize/reflow, appearing in incorrect positions and overlapping UI elements when sidebar expands or pane dimensions change.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Register `onResize` handler in `SuggestAddon.activate()` to dismiss widget on terminal dimension changes\r\n- Add test coverage for resize event handling\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nactivate(xterm: Terminal): void {\r\n    this._terminal = xterm;\r\n    this._register(xterm.onKey(async e => { ... }));\r\n    this._register(xterm.onScroll(() => this.hideSuggestWidget(true)));\r\n    this._register(xterm.onResize(() => this.hideSuggestWidget(true))); // new\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nPattern mirrors existing `onScroll` dismissal behavior. Widget now hides on any layout-driven resize event.\r\n\r\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n<summary>Original prompt</summary>\r\n\r\n> \r\n> ----\r\n> \r\n> *This section details on the original issue you should resolve*\r\n> \r\n> <issue_title>Terminal suggestions aren't dismissed when terminal is resized or moved</issue_title>\r\n> <issue_description>Testing microsoft/vscode#258293\r\n> \r\n> 1. Trigger suggestions in terminal\r\n> 2. Resize the terminal or use a command that shifts it around (such as expanding the sidebar)\r\n> \r\n> **bug**\r\n> Terminal suggestions are still showing \r\n> \r\n> <img width=\"1246\" height=\"686\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8595db6-5d07-40f5-8a53-8bb0ddea5423\" /></issue_description>\r\n> \r\n> ## Comments on the Issue (you are @copilot in this section)\r\n> \r\n> <comments>\r\n> </comments>\r\n> \r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n- Fixes microsoft/vscode#258694\r\n\r\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT TIPS -->\r\n---\r\n\r\n✨ Let Copilot coding agent [set things up for you](https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/new?title=✨+Set+up+Copilot+instructions&body=Configure%20instructions%20for%20this%20repository%20as%20documented%20in%20%5BBest%20practices%20for%20Copilot%20coding%20agent%20in%20your%20repository%5D%28https://gh.io/copilot-coding-agent-tips%29%2E%0A%0A%3COnboard%20this%20repo%3E&assignees=copilot) — coding agent works faster and does higher quality work when set up for your repo.\r\n",
