      {
        "id": "review:microsoft/vscode#275576:3423102617",
        "repository": "microsoft/vscode",
        "pullNumber": 275576,
        "state": "COMMENTED",
        "body": "## Pull Request Overview\n\nFixes terminal suggestions remaining visible in incorrect positions after terminal resize events. When the terminal dimensions change (e.g., from sidebar expansion or manual resize), the suggestion widget now properly dismisses itself.\n\n**Key changes:**\n- Added `onResize` event handler to dismiss suggestion widget on terminal dimension changes\n- New handler follows same dismissal pattern as existing `onScroll` handler\n\n\n\n",
        "author": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]",
