        "pullNumber": 284149,
        "state": "COMMENTED",
        "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR fixes an issue where the terminal suggest widget doesn't properly reposition itself when the terminal is resized. The fix adds a new `relayout` method to the `SimpleSuggestWidget` that can be called to reposition the widget, and wires it up to the terminal's resize event.\n\n**Key changes:**\n- Added a public `relayout()` method to `SimpleSuggestWidget` that repositions the widget when visible\n- Connected the terminal's `onResize` event to trigger relayout of the suggest widget\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 2 out of 2 changed files in this pull request and generated no comments.\n\n| File | Description |\n| ---- | ----------- |\n| src/vs/workbench/services/suggest/browser/simpleSuggestWidget.ts | Adds `relayout()` method to reposition the widget with updated cursor position |\n| src/vs/workbench/contrib/terminalContrib/suggest/browser/terminalSuggestAddon.ts | Registers resize event handler and implements `_relayoutOnResize()` to call the widget's relayout method |\n\n\n\n",
        "author": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]",
